orgia, serif; font-weight: normal; margin: 0; padding: 0;" align=3D"left">
<strong style=3D"font-weight: 700;">Our year-end goal to defend the Guardia=
n=E2=80=99s journalism</strong>
<br><br>
We hope you appreciated this newsletter. To keep the Guardian going strong,=
 can you join our most essential fundraising campaign of the year? Our goal=
 is to raise $2 million by the end of the year.
<br><br>
According to a leading global watchdog, US democracy is now more imperiled =
than at any point since the 1960s. Press freedom is under threat on many fr=
onts. Most recently, Donald Trump banned CNN, MS Now and Politico from the =
White House, in retaliation for =E2=80=9Cnegative=E2=80=9D coverage. While =
a federal judge has restored White House access for now, saying the ban is =
likely unconstitutional, the case is still in the courts.
<br><br>
At the same time, Trump is using the Federal Communications Commission =E2=
=80=93 a supposedly independent regulator =E2=80=93 to settle political sco=
res: The FCC targeted ABC after Jimmy Kimmel made a joke about the First La=
dy, and Trump suggested that the agency should punish the host of Meet the =
Press for making a factual statement the president disliked. <br><br>Attack=
s on the free press make it more difficult to get fact-based reporting.<br>=
<br>Making matters worse, many of the US=E2=80=99s largest news organizatio=
ns are now owned by billionaires whose personal and business interests may =
imperil the outlets=E2=80=99 editorial independence. The Guardian is owned =
neither by a billionaire nor a corporation and remains dedicated to keeping=
 trustworthy journalism paywall-free for the world.
<br><br>
<strong style=3D"font-weight: 700;">Despite the risks of maintaining our fi=
erce independence, what fills us with deep gratitude is the unwavering supp=
ort we=E2=80=99ve seen from readers. Your support not only powers our work,=
 but more importantly, it safeguards the financial independence that underp=
ins our editorial freedom and courage.</strong>
<br><br>
 <b><span style=3D"background-color: #ffe500;"><a href=3D"https://ablink.ed=
itorial.theguardian.com/ss/c/u001.zFrJr-OAD6MUXPGxMNJG7JWM3rcrR0R48aTRSRaOx=
